  "contract": "Mercenary for Hire! and High-Risk are open-world states; inside a battleground the battleground team decides the player's faction. A Human High-Risk Mercenary whom cross-faction queueing places on the Horde side of Warsong Gulch keeps Mercenary for Hire! but it has no effect there, and High-Risk turns itself off and is remembered: the server and their own client give them the Horde faction and the two can attack each other. Back outside, High-Risk returns and the Mercenary is an Outlaw again: a same-faction High-Risk player can attack them and receives faction 1163. Rendering and banner or flag clicks are untested.",
